preserved swaps only for a vendor starting "Br"), version 1.4, SURFACE_TYPE with the multisample-resolve-box and
swap-preserved bits; EGL_PRESERVED_RESOURCES refused as on the phone; any other unknown config attribute named in
the log (hostgl.cpp khrEglNote).

